            "detailed_description": "<h1>Strategy guides and other resources available at </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A haunted San Francisco mansion is waiting on you to solve your next case as detective Nancy Drew! Dare to uncover clues and face your fears in a paranormal atmosphere where accidents, ghostly figures, and a dark past threaten your investigation. Prepare for the scare, from a mysterious séance to meeting suspects and apparitions alike. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover who — or what — is behind the mysterious accidents in a house full of secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew is invited, by a friend, to San Francisco to assist in the renovation of a Victorian mansion. But there are other uninvited guests, visitors from the past–spirits who want the place all to themselves. Nancy suspects that there is another force at work: greed. In a house full of trap doors and secret tunnels, breaking glass and suspicious fires, one misstep and Nancy won’t stand a ghost of a chance in Nancy Drew: Message in a Haunted Mansion!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A haunted San Francisco mansion is waiting on you to solve your next case as detective Nancy Drew! Dare to uncover clues and face your fears in a paranormal atmosphere where accidents, ghostly figures, and a dark past threaten your investigation. Prepare for the scare, from a mysterious séance to meeting suspects and apparitions alike. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover who — or what — is behind the mysterious accidents in a house full of secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew is invited, by a friend, to San Francisco to assist in the renovation of a Victorian mansion. But there are other uninvited guests, visitors from the past–spirits who want the place all to themselves. Nancy suspects that there is another force at work: greed. In a house full of trap doors and secret tunnels, breaking glass and suspicious fires, one misstep and Nancy won’t stand a ghost of a chance in Nancy Drew: Message in a Haunted Mansion!</p>",
